# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RXSCAN AI — ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES TEMPLATE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to `.env` or `.env.local`
# 2. Replace the placeholder values below with your actual secret keys.
# 3. NEVER commit your actual `.env` file to version control.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Groq AI Vision ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get your free API key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
# Required for the Llama-4 Scout multimodal extraction engine.
GROQ_API_KEY="gsk_your_groq_api_key_here"

# ── Database (Neon Serverless PostgreSQL) ────────────────────────
# Get your connection string from your Neon dashboard.
# Ensure you use the "pooled" connection string (ends in ?sslmode=require) for Serverless/Vercel environments.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://[user]:[password]@[neon_hostname]/neondb?sslmode=require"

